states: [observed]
```

### Entity: Documentation

Product description, architecture, integration contracts, and repository instructions.

```yaml
entity: Documentation
type: component
properties:
  adr:
    default: docs/adrs/README.md
  paths:
    default: README.md CLAUDE.md docs/
states: [observed]
```

### Entity: Postgres

PostgreSQL/PostGIS database service, separate from the pipeline and app (db/README.md, issues
#103-#110). `geo`/`risk` are dbmate-migrated (Jay-owned); `app` is Drizzle-migrated (application-owned,
issue #62). Only a `geo` bootstrap (`db/migrations/`) and its interim runner (`db/scripts/`) exist here
so far — the full service scaffold (compose, roles, pgTAP) is #103, not yet built.

```yaml
entity: Postgres
type: component
properties:
  adr:
    default: docs/adrs/0004-postgres-schema-ownership.md
  paths:
    default: db/
states: [observed]
```

## Planned systems

### Entity: AstroApplication

Completed Astro application and app-core migration, owned by #54/#63. The frontend/ foundation exists; production routes and server-service migration are still pending.

```yaml
entity: AstroApplication
type: planned
properties:
  adr:
    default: docs/adrs/0002-astro-and-app-core.md
  status:
    default: planned
states: [planned]
```

### Entity: FastApiRisk

Completed Python/FastAPI risk API and exported consumer handoff, owned by #82/#79. JAXA heat indices and layers are observed under Pipeline; remaining hazards, typed app integration and live-data acceptance remain under #36/#77/#79.

```yaml
entity: FastApiRisk
type: planned
properties:
  adr:
    default: docs/adrs/0003-risk-api-and-keeper.md
  status:
    default: planned
states: [planned]
```

## Relationships

### Relationship: Contracts → Shared

```yaml
relationship: Contracts -> Shared
verb: exports
description: Contract ABI and Trigger agreement; coordinated review required.
```

### Relationship: Application → Shared

```yaml
relationship: Application -> Shared
verb: depends_on
description: Existing consumer validation, ABI calls, and signing types.
```

### Relationship: AstroApplication → FastApiRisk

```yaml
relationship: AstroApplication -> FastApiRisk
verb: depends_on
description: Planned typed handoff under #55/#79; not observed runtime traffic.
```

### Relationship: AstroApplication → Postgres

```yaml
relationship: AstroApplication -> Postgres
verb: depends_on
description: A Railway PostgreSQL/PostGIS instance now exists (db/postgres-plots task) with an app schema Drizzle-migrated from web/; AstroApplication (frontend/) itself has not been wired to it.
```
